# 🩻 DICOM File Loading using pydicom

## Overview
This example demonstrates how to load and visualize a DICOM (Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine) file using Python.

DICOM is a standard format widely used in medical imaging such as CT scans, X-rays, and MRI. In this example, a sample DICOM file is loaded using the `pydicom` library and displayed using `matplotlib`.

